{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"舞步带着面向众人的庄严，歌声却像私人记忆里的低声哼唱。\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以把它听成两层声音：舞曲带着一点面向众人的庄严，歌声却像私人记忆里的低声哼唱。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确把两层声音标为一种可选的听法，屏幕稿却把它写成音乐确定具有的特征。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"他把自己收拾得挺拔，不让别人看出动摇；反复对自己说“我没事”：第一次还有几分相信，第二次开始努力相信，到第三次，连这句话都暴露出他其实很在意\",\n      \"source\": \"这种挺拔的姿态，可以听成一种强烈的自我控制。像一个人整理好衣服、抬起头，不让别人看见动摇；到44–65小节，它又像反复对自己说“我没事”：第一次还有几分相信，第二次开始努力让自己相信，说到第三次，连反复说这句话本身都暴露出：其实还是很在意。\",\n      \"type\": 6,\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿中的整理衣服、抬头和反复说“我没事”都是对音乐的比喻性想象，屏幕稿却直接写成了他实际做过的动作和真实的内心活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"那点高兴一退，他又酸起来\",\n      \"source\": \"可那点高兴还没退，他心里就酸了\",\n      \"type\": 7,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿写的是高兴尚未消退时酸涩就已经出现，屏幕稿改成了高兴消退之后才产生酸涩，改变了情绪发生的先后关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"等昂扬慢慢退潮，他又问：刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力相信\",\n      \"source\": \"音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将这句话限定为音乐仿佛引出的自问，屏幕稿去掉了这种不确定性，直接写成他又产生了这个疑问。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"带着面向外部的昂扬和一点集体感\",\n      \"source\": \"它也可以听成一种面向外部、公开的昂扬，甚至带一点集体感。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿提供的是一种可选的音乐理解，屏幕稿将其改成了音乐确定具有的情绪属性。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6281fc5f-e6a2-414c-a2fb-50edf52a5533", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T175018468621Z", "elapsed_seconds": 485.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T17:58:24.109089+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4dfdb942279e2ca722839d7dc0ef0ff6cbfb3f456bc07b8cc531eb2b6c04e1d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T175018468621Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3ae74fb8ef32f7e018f679a14274bf71a5aa7a0d00ace41e297a19c424867986"}}}
